  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Mɛ̈T 19",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋi̱i̱c kɛ kui̱ da̱k mään",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Yecu thuɔ̱k kɛ lat kä ti̱ti̱, cuɛ jiɛɛn kä Gɛ̈-lɛ-li, kä cuɛ wä ro̱o̱l Ju-dia kui̱c Kiɛɛr Jɔr-dɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bua̱n nath ti di̱t jɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä cuɛ kɛ jakä gɔw ɛn wi̱ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ Pa-ri-thii ben kä jɛ, kä cukɛ jɛ ɣɔ̱n cu kɛ thieci, “Ɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ ɛn ɣöö bi wut ciekdɛ däk kɛ kui̱ kä duɔ̱ɔ̱r?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “/Ken yɛn ɛ kuɛn, ɛn ɣöö jɛn ram ëë cak naath ni tukä ɣɔaa, cɛ kɛ cak ala tuut kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱ɔ̱t, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cuɛ wee i̱, ‘Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ bi wut gua̱n kɛnɛ man ba̱ny piny, kä ba jɛ mat kɛnɛ ciekdɛ, kä bi kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw a puɔ̱ny kɛl?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ /cikɛ lɛ ŋot ala rɛw, kɛ kɛl. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ mɔ ci Kuoth ɛ mat kɛɛl ɔ, a thil ram mi dääk jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ Yecu thiec i̱, “Kä ɛŋu ci Muthɛ jɛ la̱t kɔ mɔ, i̱ ba ciek ka̱m warɛgak lotdä däkädɛ, kä ba jɛ jakä wä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ ɣöö bum wuɔ̱thkun, cu Muthɛ yɛ cu pa̱l ɣöö bia mänkun däk, duundɛ ɣöö /cɛ te inɔ ni tukä ɣɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, ram mi wä ciekdɛ däk a /ciɛ kɛ kui̱ leerä, kä kuɛnɛ ciek dɔ̱diɛn lätdɛ nyin leerä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Mi ɛ jɛn ciaŋ wutdä kɛnɛ ciekdɛ, dee gɔaa ni ɣöö /ci raan dee kuɛɛn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “/Cikɛ nɛy diaal dee ŋi̱i̱c ɛmɛ nhɔk ɔ, ɛ ni nɛy tin ca ka̱mkɛ kärɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö te ɣöwni thi̱n ni däpädiɛn, kä te jiöwni thi̱n ti ca kuit ɛ nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn, kɛ jiöwni kɔ̱kiɛn tin ca rɔ̱ jakä jiöwni kɛ kui̱ kuäärä nhial. Ɛ ram mi nhɔk ŋi̱i̱c ɛmɛ, lät jɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔ̱th Yecu kɛ gaat ti tiɛtni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua gaat nöŋ jɛ kɛ ɣöö derɛ tetkɛ la̱th wuɔ̱thnikiɛn, kä bɛ pal kɛ kui̱diɛn. Cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ naath tin nööŋkɛ kɛ yɔ̱r, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu Yecu wee i̱, “A gaat bëë kä ɣä, kä /cuarɛ kɛ pen ben kɛ ɣöö kuäär nhial ɛ duŋ nɛɛni ti ce̱tkɛ kɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tetkɛ la̱th wuɔ̱thnikiɛn, kä cuɛ wä dupdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɛ̈t mi riäŋ riäŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ, cu ram kɛl ben kä Yecu wëë i̱, “Ŋi̱i̱c, ɛŋu mi gɔaa mi bä la̱t, kɛ ɣöö bä tëk mi do̱raar jek?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɛŋu mi thieci ɣä kɛ kui̱ kä mi gɔaa? Ɛ ram kɛl kärɔa gɔaa ɔ. Mi go̱o̱ri ɣöö bi te rɛy tee kä, käp ni luëëk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ Yecu jiök i̱, “Ɛ mi̱th?” Kä cu Yecu wee i̱, “/Cu raan näk, /cu dho̱m, /cu kuel, /cu ruac kacä lat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luthni guur kɛnɛ muɔɔr, kä nhɔk gua̱n thieekädu ce̱tkɛ rɔɔdu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ŋuɛ̈t ɛ jiök i̱, “Cä ti̱ti̱ diaal la̱t, ɛŋu mi ŋot jɔ̱ɔ̱r kä ɣä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ jiök i̱, “Mi go̱o̱ri ɣöö bi a ram mi gɔaa, wër kɔkni nyinku, kä kämni yio̱w nɛy tin can, kä bi riaŋ jek cieŋ nhial. Kä bër guuri ɣä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ŋuɛ̈t ɛmɔ mɛmɛ liŋ, cuɛ jiɛɛn kɛ jiath lɔaac, kɛ ɣöö tëë kɛ ŋɔak ti ŋuan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, bɛ buɔ̱m ɛ tet ɛn ɣöö bi ram mi riäŋ riäŋ coth cieŋ kuäärä nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ bä, i̱ thia̱kni ɣöö bi thɔ̱rɔ̱l cooth kɛ waŋ riɛp kä coth raam mi riäŋ riäŋ cieŋ kuäärä Kuɔth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ji̱ kɔaarɛ mɛmɛ liŋ, cukɛ ga̱a̱c ɛlɔ̱ŋ, cukɛ wee i̱, “Kä ɛŋa mi dee kään?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu kɛ guic, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Mɛmɛ /cɛ rɔ dee met luäŋ kä naath, kä ŋɔak diaal lua̱ŋkɛ rɔ̱ kä Kuoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
